<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Heart Mind</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Kodak Black</ttm:agent><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v2">Plies</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">FEMA (Finesse Elevate Motivate Achieve)</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">2OPxM2L3KtuehqY24vTMGs</ttm:item><itunes:duration>03:23.000</itunes:duration></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:00.000" end="00:01.500">Heart &amp; Mind - Kodak Black/Plies</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:01.110" end="00:06.520">It's like got all I need got no self-control no more</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:06.520" end="00:08.140">Sonny Digital Digital</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:08.140" end="00:10.610">I be tryna keep it gangsta and sh*t but you know</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:10.610" end="00:14.060">You be having me on that sweet sh*t</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.060" end="00:17.280">You got my heart got my mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.280" end="00:20.140">I think about you all the time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.140" end="00:23.870">You shoot my blood pressure through the sky</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.870" end="00:27.170">If you leave my side I swear I'll die</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.170" end="00:30.520">Girl you got me I don't need nobody</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.520" end="00:33.770">I'm in love with you and just yo body</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.770" end="00:37.150">And I hope we never separate</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.150" end="00:40.230">I wonder do you feel the same</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.230" end="00:43.550">Girl you got me got look no more</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.550" end="00:46.650">I'm all yours only if you want me to</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.650" end="00:50.010">And there ain't no pressure I ain't no rushin' nigga</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.010" end="00:53.520">But bae I got a lotta feelings for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.520" end="00:56.650">I got different stashes dog I love them routes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.650" end="00:59.900">But I got all this money in my CD account</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.900" end="01:03.220">You see I'm gettin' all the cheese like Mickey Mouse</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.220" end="01:06.570">Would you still be here if I'm goin' through a drought</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.570" end="01:09.880">You in and out bae what you about bae</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.880" end="01:11.520">Do you want my heart bae</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.520" end="01:13.200">Or you want my clout bae</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.200" end="01:16.460">You got my heart you got my soul you got my mental</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.460" end="01:20.250">I'm talkin' 'bout you even on the instrumental</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.250" end="01:23.500">You got my heart got my mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.500" end="01:26.360">I think about you all the time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.360" end="01:30.080">You shoot my blood pressure through the sky</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.080" end="01:33.390">If you leave my side I swear I'll die</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.390" end="01:36.770">Bae you got me I don't need nobody</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.770" end="01:40.030">I'm in love with you just yo body</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.030" end="01:43.510">And I hope we never separate</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.510" end="01:46.440">I wonder do you feel the same</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.440" end="01:49.560">You know I love you babe I'll help take your weave out</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.560" end="01:52.920">You know I'm f**ked up about you sitting around your people house</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.920" end="01:56.430">If I was Kodak right now baby I would sing to you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.430" end="01:59.690">I won't even like to kiss but I'll be kissing you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.690" end="02:02.950">I can smell you on my sheets it got me missing you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.950" end="02:06.280">You ain't no ps4 or NES so I won't play with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.280" end="02:09.400">I won't even like to cuddle but I'll be all under you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.400" end="02:12.610">I know this sh*t getting very real cause I'll be claiming you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.610" end="02:16.050">I had a dream f**ked around and put my name on you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.050" end="02:19.470">I was ashamed of my last b**ch but I ain't ashamed of you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.470" end="02:22.620">I ain't no vain baby I hope we never separate</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:22.620" end="02:25.930">When you ain't around to hold around I keep a poker face</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:25.930" end="02:29.230">I love looking at you that's why I got you as my screensaver</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:29.230" end="02:32.680">Sometimes I won't know why you stay around 'cause I'm so complicated</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:32.680" end="02:35.930">You my red velvet babe I want a slice of you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:35.930" end="02:39.550">And I can see myself spendin' my whole life with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:39.550" end="02:42.910">You got my heart got my mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:42.910" end="02:45.810">I think about you all the time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:45.810" end="02:49.490">You shoot my blood pressure through the sky</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:49.490" end="02:52.840">If you leave my side I swear I'll die</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:52.840" end="02:56.070">Bae you got me I don't need nobody</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:56.070" end="02:59.380">I'm in love with you and just yo body</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:59.380" end="03:02.730">And I hope we never separate</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:02.730" end="03:06.730">I wonder do you feel the same</p></div></body></tt>